	(text "RTC: copied from the Radxa Rock 5B v1.45 schematic, sheet 5 (HYM8563, pin-compatible with PCF8563).\n  Its 32 kHz output also feeds the Wi-Fi slot; the pull-up goes to +3V3 here (1.8 V on the reference).\nFan: copied from sheet 20 (low-side switch on GPIO0_C0 with a flyback diode).\nThread / Matter radio: ESP32-H2-MINI-1 on UART3. Not from the reference: the enable RC, strap pull-ups\n  and pin use follow the module datasheet (vendor/lcsc_C18203134). LCSC showed this module out of stock.\nDebug port: UART2 at 3.3 V on a three-pin header.\nThe TPM is on its own sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
